MacRight

MacRight references the design and behavior of MacNewFile:
https://github.com/GarfieldFluffJr/MacNewFile

The AppIcon asset catalog is copied unchanged from MacNewFile.
The five New File menu icons in Resources/MenuIcons are also copied unchanged
from MacNewFileFinderExtension/Assets.xcassets: edit, document, word, excel,
and powerpoint image sets. Only their resource file names have changed.
The text and Markdown icons use the system template rendering mode for light
and dark appearances; the three Office icons retain their original colors.
Reference baseline: local MacNewFile commit
9fd2a1b4a18d606701bd57fd8acca94c26b6268d.
Credit for the reused assets remains with the original project contributors.

MacRight uses the GNU General Public License, version 3, as included in LICENSE.

The three Office template documents were supplied by the project owner.
Their repository copies have author and document identifier metadata removed.
See Resources/README.md and Resources/Templates/manifest.json for provenance
and the exact scope of these resource changes, dated 2026-10-25.
